---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How to Contribute to Knowledge Hub" description="Open-source guide on submitting new topics, fixing typos, and proposing roadmap improvements.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500">Open Collaboration</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mt-1">
        Contribute to Knowledge Hub
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">
        Knowledge Hub ek open-source community platform hai. Agar aapko koi typo dikhe ya naya topic add karna ho, toh directly GitHub par Pull Request open karein!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-darkcard border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkborder space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">🚀 Step-by-Step Contribution Flow</h3>
        <ol class="space-y-2 list-decimal pl-5">
          <li><strong>Fork the Repository:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/givemehat/knowledge-hub" target="_blank" class="text-emerald-500 underline">github.com/givemehat/knowledge-hub</a> par jaakar "Fork" button dabayein.</li>
          <li><strong>Clone Locally:</strong> <code>git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/knowledge-hub.git</code></li>
          <li><strong>Add or Edit Topic:</strong> <code>src/data/topics.ts</code> file me structured topic object add karein following our schema.</li>
          <li><strong>Run Build Test:</strong> <code>npm run build</code> chala kar check karein ki build zero error ke sath pass ho rahi hai.</li>
          <li><strong>Submit Pull Request:</strong> Branch push karein aur GitHub par PR open karein.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-darkcard border border-slate-200 dark:border-darkborder space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white">📋 Quality Checklist for PRs</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 text-slate-500">
          <li>Har claim ke sath kam se kam 1 primary source citation hona chahiye.</li>
          <li>TL;DR me exactly 3-5 crisp bullet points hone chahiye.</li>
          <li>Hinglish natural aur approachable honi chahiye, bina artificial heavy translations ke.</li>
          <li>Code snippets runnable aur minimal hone chahiye.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
